    "input_texts": [
      "Title: ServiceNow Change Request Filter Construction\nDescription: Step-by-step workflow for building a multi-condition AND filter on the Change Request list.\n- Open the filter panel by clicking the 'Show / hide filter' control on the Change Request list page.\n- Select the first field from the combobox labeled 'All of these conditions must be met. -- choose field --'.\n- Choose the field value by clicking the corresponding combobox (e.g., 'Choose option for field: Type') and selecting the desired option (e.g., 'Normal').\n- Add the next condition by clicking the button labeled 'Add AND Condition To Condition X: [Previous Field] is [Previous Value]'.\n- Repeat the field selection, value selection, and 'Add AND Condition' steps for each required filter criterion (Requested by, Model, Short description, State).\n- For empty string conditions, use the operator combobox to select 'is empty string' before adding the next condition."
