    "input_texts": [
      "Title: ServiceNow Filter UI Interaction Pitfalls\nDescription: Key UI signals and interaction patterns specific to the ServiceNow filter panel.\n- The field chooser is a combobox with the label 'All of these conditions must be met. -- choose field --'.\n- Value selection for fields often requires using `select_option` on the value chooser combobox if direct clicking fails.\n- The 'Add AND Condition' button text dynamically updates to reflect the previous condition (e.g., 'Add AND Condition To Condition 1: Type is Normal').\n- The 'Model' field condition for an empty value requires selecting the 'is empty string' operator from the operator combobox.\n- The filter panel controls are contained within the element controlled by 'change_requestfilterdiv'.\n- Field choosers appear as listboxes when opened, while value and operator choosers appear as menus.\n- The 'Requested by' field uses a standard textbox input for entering values like 'System Administrator'."
